## Source
Path A UX dry-run (0152), severity: **Low**

## Context
`integration.md` step 2 ("Add this line to your AGENTS.md") gives no signal
that this step is only relevant for AI coding agent users. A developer not using
agents will be confused about what AGENTS.md is, and won't know if skipping it
is safe.

## Fix
Prefix step 2 with: "*(Skip if you are not using AI coding agents.)*"
And/or add a one-liner to create AGENTS.md if missing:
```bash
echo "git-erg local tickets: see tickets/AGENTS.md" >> AGENTS.md
```

## Exit criteria
- [ ] integration.md step 2 makes clear it is optional for non-agent users
